(Let's restructure.)
(Goal: we need origin_task_profile_linked for authorize and also for allocate_dispatch_slot_for_candidate origin (requires link) and for confirm_candidate_preparedness origin (we already did). After we have prepared origin, we can detach its task profile temporarily, prepare destination, then reattach to origin for authorize and allocation/dispatch.)
