(- Mark destination dispatch ready (requires destination locked/confirmed, leg assembled, loading authorized).)
(- (Note: mark dispatch ready can be done after allocate or before; doesn't matter as long as preconditions satisfied.))
(- Prepare shift_candidate_beta: attach task profile, allocate vehicle, confirm preparedness.)
(- Detach shift_candidate_beta task profile (optional).)
